  "name": "Black Tentacles",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Each creature in the 20-ft square makes a STR save: 3d6 Bludgeoning and Restrained until the spell ends on a failure. A creature entering the area or ending its turn there makes the save too, once per turn. A Restrained creature can use an action to make a STR (Athletics) check against your DC to escape (the DM removes the condition).</p>",
